        const value = valueParts.join('=');
        process.env[key] = value;  // ⚠️ Direct environment variable assignment
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Security Risks:**
- No validation of environment variable names (could inject reserved variables)
- No input sanitization of values (could contain null bytes, control characters)
- Multiple fallback locations increase attack surface
- No integrity verification of credential files

**Recommendation:**
